00:59:05.810 --> 00:59:08.910
of a pole with no life jacket disappearing into the night.
杆子，没穿救生衣，消失在夜色中。

1563
00:59:09.070 --> 00:59:14.030
And she remembers thinking that if NBC knew that their star was just not, didn't have a
