life jacket and was, you know, being pulled off back to the harbor, they would be upset.
穿救生衣，而且正被拖回港口，他们肯定会气疯的。

1565
00:59:18.710 --> 00:59:26.770
And then she got on the boat and she thought it was Oscar, Brian, and somebody from the
然后她上了船，她以为那是奥斯卡、布莱恩，还有服装部门的

1566
00:59:26.770 --> 00:59:27.690
wardrobe department.
某个人。

1567
00:59:28.590 --> 00:59:30.410
I wrote about it the day of.
我当天就写下了这件事。

1568
00:59:30.430 --> 00:59:30.710
But that was you.
但那个人是你。

1569
00:59:30.950 --> 00:59:31.110
Yeah.
没错。

1570
00:59:31.490 --> 00:59:33.290
No, she says, I'm not sure if Angela was there or not.
不，她说，我不确定安吉拉当时在不在。

1571
00:59:33.650 --> 00:59:36.450
And then she talks, everything was fine pulling away.
然后她说，刚开走的时候一切都好。

1572
00:59:36.670 --> 00:59:39.590
We were enjoying the smell of the ocean, the lights in the distance.
我们享受着海水的味道，看着远处的灯光。

