The engine died.
引擎熄火了。

1575
00:59:43.570 --> 00:59:44.390
So you were there.
所以你当时也在场。

1576
00:59:44.390 --> 00:59:49.590
So this is what I wrote the day after we filmed the scene.
这是我拍完那场戏的第二天写的。

1577
00:59:49.930 --> 00:59:50.390
All right.
好的。

1578
00:59:50.510 --> 00:59:53.950
I wrote, one of the coolest things that happened to me while we shot this episode happened the
