大船上，在卡座里睡觉。

1583
01:00:08.250 --> 01:00:08.490
Yeah.
是啊。

1584
01:00:08.710 --> 01:00:12.950
Or they said they had these little rubber boats that would pull up next to the big boat that
或者他们说有那种小橡皮艇会停在大船旁边，

1585
01:00:12.950 --> 01:00:14.870
