非常不稳定。

1594
01:00:30.510 --> 01:00:30.810
Very-
非常——

1595
01:00:30.810 --> 01:00:32.970
Phyllis said that at one point she had to switch boats.
菲利斯说有一次她不得不换船。

1596
01:00:32.970 --> 01:00:34.630
