她吓坏了，怕掉进水里。

1597
01:00:34.710 --> 01:00:35.070
Yes.
是的。

1598
01:00:35.070 --> 01:00:41.630
And I said, okay, the little rubber boat, picture the kind of like rubber boat that the
我说，好吧，那个小橡皮艇，想象一下那种

