01:00:47.630 --> 01:00:54.510
So we're lowered down into it and it was me, Rain, Jen, one of our wardrobe gals, Phyllis
我们被放了下去，当时在船上的有我、雷恩、简，还有我们服装组的姑娘菲利斯

1602
01:00:54.510 --> 01:00:55.010
and Brian.
以及布莱恩。

1603
01:00:55.330 --> 01:00:57.170
It was tiny and really bouncy.
那船很小，而且晃得厉害。

1604
01:00:57.350 --> 01:00:57.910
We took off.
我们出发了。

1605
01:00:58.010 --> 01:01:00.750
It was dark out and the ocean looked like black glass.
外面天很黑，海面看起来像黑色的玻璃。

1606
01:01:00.930 --> 01:01:02.070
It was very peaceful.
非常宁静。

1607
01:01:02.410 --> 01:01:03.530
Oh, it's so poetic.
噢，太有诗意了。

1608
01:01:03.530 --> 01:01:04.030
Yeah, yeah.
是啊，是啊。

1609
01:01:04.250 --> 01:01:04.730
Sorry.
抱歉。

1610
01:01:05.170 --> 01:01:10.330
About five minutes into our ride, our engine made a weird whirring sound and stopped working.
航行了大约五分钟后，引擎发出奇怪的嗡嗡声，然后就停转了。

1611
01:01:11.010 --> 01:01:14.930
And then we heard the boat driver radio and say, the engine's dead.
接着我们听到船夫用无线电说，引擎坏了。

1612
01:01:15.030 --> 01:01:16.190
You need to come get us.
你们得来接我们。

1613
01:01:16.490 --> 01:01:19.470
Brian started laughing and said, you've got to be kidding me.
布莱恩大笑起来，说，你在跟我开玩笑吧。

1614
01:01:20.170 --> 01:01:23.810
Then we just floated in the darkness, which felt like for a while.
然后我们就漂浮在黑暗中，感觉过了好久。

1615
01:01:24.510 --> 01:01:26.730
It was quiet and peaceful.
四周安静又平和。

1616
01:01:26.950 --> 01:01:27.990
It turned into the Titanic.
简直变成了泰坦尼克号现场。

1617
01:01:28.270 --> 01:01:28.750
I know.
我知道。

1618
01:01:28.930 --> 01:01:29.590
I know.
我知道。

1619
01:01:29.590 --> 01:01:35.230
Oh, and then we, another rubber boat pulled up and then we had to just straddle from one
噢，后来我们，另一艘橡皮艇靠了过来，我们不得不跨过去，

1620
